{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ba0cbafd8fb9d63ee4c9a5dd9fe3aa4a844639f10969664d401baa209b4af9ee",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23:5_02_028_23:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be483504f0c2ccc5901641e9c590e067a5fec91d625e92e2e60a658c8942b3da",
      "text": "一直在恭候您的光临，●●●●プロデューサー。\n请到这边的座位就座吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23:5_02_028_23:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8518d0eb315ca81bad47e93f16436a09c8942a2ace3c09797d2e00406d0cfbab",
      "text": "今天承蒙您的邀请非常感谢。\n……哎呀？这是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23:5_02_028_23:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d761c135fb6535c7b47a7f8333c1c89ad3425c801e9b704b2aa95a09cbf78bbe",
      "text": "这是做成圆顶状的巧克力。\n里面包着蛋糕哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23:5_02_028_23:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4403d7536f69caca1de67fb9a0bae6549672661241a047bd3d8b3c49644a44fc",
      "text": "只要从上面淋上隔水融化的热巧克力酱……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23:5_02_028_23:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cbb6145f365a588ee9426331f2c99014255bf02ad6d0ae053f4e0565e3e51e9",
      "text": "圆顶融化开来，\n从里面露出了小巧的蛋糕……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23:5_02_028_23:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b456bb609ad5c0924c91c1354b96d75591fc5462e24fa357229814e076e06fd",
      "text": "这样就大功告成了。\n请慢用，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23:5_02_028_23:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9cbc61237e7231ab250649b83d1609b028b9db107411aa2bb09e08a857b318f",
      "text": "那么，我就开动啦。\n……超级美味！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23:5_02_028_23:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f023ddf2a9d884c2bfbe6c7665ac2d929150c5c956fd936b50a0f0986e606ece",
      "text": "能合您的口味真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23:5_02_028_23:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53e679e8d2686d0844dedf4112565456e85deb102232ff58559e52dd02bb3276",
      "text": "今年也收到了您送给我的精美巧克力，\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_23_5_02_028_23:5_02_028_23:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4816f8b9e4ec7b0062ee5339591eccd96e034d1bdfecb403bf4c61e935d09c63",
      "text": "若能通过这份回礼哪怕稍微报答一些制作人的心意，\n对我而言便比什么都值得高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
